 # Point One — build the difference
 
-Start with [the supplied Point One study](../../../doc/book/studies/point-one/README.md). Import its `project.godot` in Godot 4.6 and run it with F6 from `study.tscn`, or F5 for the project. It is a small separate project with a fixed camera, floor, lights and three labels already placed. You do not need the museum or its add-ons to run these first three constructions.
+Use [the Point One study](../../../doc/book/studies/point-one/README.md) in the environment prepared in [Day Zero](../../../doc/book/day-zero.md). Its `study.tscn` inherits the same `base.tscn` and replaces the greeting with three point stations.
 
